#: includes/Rest/Controller.php:73
msgid "You do not have permission to access the ARkid Catalogue Link API."
msgstr "Je hebt geen rechten om de ARkid Catalogue Link API te benaderen."

#: includes/Rest/Controller.php:162
msgid "No ARkid API key configured. Set one under WooCommerce → Settings → Integration → ARkid Catalogue Link."
msgstr "Geen ARkid-API-sleutel geconfigureerd. Stel er één in onder WooCommerce → Instellingen → Integratie → ARkid Catalogue Link."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:26
msgid "Connect this store to your ARkid catalogue. The 3D / AR viewer you pick on each product is rendered on the product display page."
msgstr "Verbind deze winkel met je ARkid-catalogus. De 3D-/AR-viewer die je per product kiest, wordt weergegeven op de productpagina."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:49
msgid "First image (image gallery)"
msgstr "Eerste afbeelding (afbeeldingengalerij)"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:50
msgid "Last image (image gallery, opens in modal)"
msgstr "Laatste afbeelding (afbeeldingengalerij, opent in modaal)"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:53
msgid "Button only (View in 3D)"
msgstr "Alleen knop (Bekijk in 3D)"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:58
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API-sleutel"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:60
msgid "API key from your ARkid catalogue account. Used as the HTTP Basic auth password (the username is always <code>woocommerce</code>)."
msgstr "API-sleutel van je ARkid-catalogusaccount. Wordt gebruikt als HTTP Basic auth-wachtwoord (de gebruikersnaam is altijd <code>woocommerce</code>)."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:65
msgid "Default viewer position"
msgstr "Standaardpositie van de viewer"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:69
msgid "Where the viewer is rendered on the product display page when no per-product override is set."
msgstr "Waar de viewer op de productpagina wordt weergegeven als er geen overschrijving per product is."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:73
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Knoptekst"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:77
msgid "Label for the standalone \"Button only\" trigger and for the modal-opening button on the last-image position. Leave empty to use the localized default for each visitor."
msgstr "Label voor de zelfstandige knop „Alleen knop“ en voor de modaal-openende knop op de positie laatste afbeelding. Laat leeg om de gelokaliseerde standaard per bezoeker te gebruiken."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:81
msgid "Require visitor consent"
msgstr "Bezoekerstoestemming vereisen"

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:83
msgid "Only load the viewer when the visitor has granted marketing consent (requires the WP Consent API plugin)."
msgstr "De viewer alleen laden wanneer de bezoeker marketingtoestemming heeft gegeven (vereist de WP Consent API plugin)."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:85
msgid "When enabled and consent is missing, the viewer area is left empty."
msgstr "Wanneer ingeschakeld en toestemming ontbreekt, blijft het viewergebied leeg."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:165
msgid "ARkid Catalogue Link: connected successfully."
msgstr "ARkid Catalogue Link: verbinding gelukt."

#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:169
msgid "ARkid Catalogue Link: API key was rejected (HTTP 403). Double-check the key."
msgstr "ARkid Catalogue Link: API-sleutel afgewezen (HTTP 403). Controleer de sleutel."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/Settings/IntegrationSettings.php:176
msgid "ARkid Catalogue Link: could not reach the API (%s). The key was saved anyway."
msgstr "ARkid Catalogue Link: kon de API niet bereiken (%s). De sleutel is toch opgeslagen."

